Z||000024||TRiAD||07-17-2001||11:31 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B>Mustang, Corvette, Viper...thats all I can think of now for U.S. sports cars....</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>OK, considering past production you would have to include the Vector W8 Twin Turbo<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.rapidcars.com/images/w8jet.jpg"> <P> and the M12 (not really a Vector, but oh well), and current production you would have to consider the Saleen S7<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.grand-am.com/teams/5saleen.jpg"> <P>and the Mosler MT900<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.moslerauto.com/discus/messages/70/30.jpg"> <P><BR>Americans don't always build Chevettes.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
